## Components
- `src/tools/mod.rs` — Tool dispatcher + `tool_definitions()`
- `src/tools/file_tools.rs` — read/write/log/note operations
- `src/tools/system_tools.rs` — status, beliefs, bayes tools
- `src/tools/email_tools.rs` — send/read/check_inbox

## Usage
- Called by Ollama tool-calling loop
- Called by CPU skill requests
- Schemas sent in every `/api/chat`

